{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[a, b, c] = (ab)c - a(bc) = e7 - (-e7) = 2 e7\n  not associative: the grouping changes the product (in the octonions)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "associator", "ucas": "associator e1, e2, e4", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "associator", "not_associative": "the grouping changes the product (in the octonions)", "headline": "[a, b, c] = (ab)c - a(bc) = e7 - (-e7) = 2 e7"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "[a, b, c] = (ab)c - a(bc) = e7 - (-e7) = 2 e7\n  not associative: the grouping changes the product (in the octonions)\n"}, "isError": false}}
