{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 15, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "rotate (1, 0, 0) by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1):\n  q = cos(theta/2) + sin(theta/2) u, u the unit axis\n  q = sqrt(2)/2 + k*sqrt(2)/2: a rotation by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1)\n  v = i (the vector as a pure quaternion)\n  q v q^-1 = j\n  rotated: (0, 1, 0)\n  check: |v'| = |v| = 1, the real part is 0, and the rotation matrix gives the same vector\n  rotation matrix:\n    [0, -1, 0]\n    [1, 0, 0]\n    [0, 0, 1]\n  (right-handed: counterclockwise looking down the axis towards the origin; -q gives the same rotation)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 15, "ok": true, "cmd": "rotate", "ucas": "rotate (1,0,0) by 90 degrees about (0,0,1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "rotate", "q": ["cos(theta/2) + sin(theta/2) u, u the unit axis", "sqrt(2)/2 + k*sqrt(2)/2: a rotation by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1)"], "v": "i (the vector as a pure quaternion)", "rotated": "(0, 1, 0)", "headline": "rotate (1, 0, 0) by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1):", "details": ["q v q^-1 = j", "rotation matrix:", "[0, -1, 0]", "[1, 0, 0]", "[0, 0, 1]", "(right-handed: counterclockwise looking down the axis towards the origin; -q gives the same rotation)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "|v'| = |v| = 1, the real part is 0, and the rotation matrix gives the same vector"}], "files": [], "text": "rotate (1, 0, 0) by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1):\n  q = cos(theta/2) + sin(theta/2) u, u the unit axis\n  q = sqrt(2)/2 + k*sqrt(2)/2: a rotation by pi/2 about (0, 0, 1)\n  v = i (the vector as a pure quaternion)\n  q v q^-1 = j\n  rotated: (0, 1, 0)\n  check: |v'| = |v| = 1, the real part is 0, and the rotation matrix gives the same vector\n  rotation matrix:\n    [0, -1, 0]\n    [1, 0, 0]\n    [0, 0, 1]\n  (right-handed: counterclockwise looking down the axis towards the origin; -q gives the same rotation)\n"}, "isError": false}}
